cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Kausalität ist Relation, nicht Sequenz: VRTCore, wissenschaftliche und menschliche Konsequenzen"
message: "Please cite the versioned Zenodo record that binds these exact files."
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: Lohmann
    given-names: Ingolf
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher; QIK-VRT"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-08-02
repository-code: "https://github.com/Goldkelch/qik-vrt"
abstract: >-
  The work develops the thesis that causality is relation rather than mere
  sequence, separates six epistemic classes, defines VRT as
  Rec(D,I,M,W,R,C,A,P), and supplies an EBNF grammar and a narrowly scoped
  21-theorem Lean 4.19 structural core. It explicitly excludes a derivation of
  physical retrocausality, backward signalling or spacetime emergence.
keywords:
  - QIK-VRT
  - causality
  - causal relation
  - epistemic classification
  - provenance
  - formal verification
  - Lean 4
  - VRTCore
